<title>USA: International Multifoods names Trubeck CFO.</title>
<headline>International Multifoods names Trubeck CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Multifoods Corp said it named William Trubeck chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Trubeck was previously chief financial officer of SPX Corp, the company said.</p>
<p>Trubeck replaces Duncan Cocroft, who resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
